Z||000010||Jay||07-15-2001||06:35 PM||||No, the heater core behind the dash on the passenger side.  It was removed and a DVD player and subs were installed.  The back of the seats were also removed and 15" subs installed. That's the last picture seen through the sun roof.  Basically everything was cut out and speakers substituted.  It wasn't a looker by any means but it was loud and had clear bass, and a great picture.||||reg||1
